  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p>We're Akalia — a women-owned jewelry brand built on one simple idea: fine jewelry you never have to take off. Ours is genuinely waterproof, so it stays on in the pool, the ocean, the gym, and the shower — no tarnish, no green skin, no second-guessing. We've been featured in Vogue and Glamour, you'll find us at Nordstrom, and every order plants a tree and removes five plastic bottles from the ocean.</p><p><br></p><p>We're growing fast, and we're building our creator community with people whose style feels like ours — elevated, effortless, a little sun-drenched. We'd love for you to be one of them.</p><p><br></p><p>Here's what joining looks like:</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>💰 18% commission on every sale you drive — with higher tiers as you grow</p><p>🏷️ A 15%-off code for your followers, so sharing feels like a gift, not a sell</p><p>🎥 Full creative freedom — no scripts, just you, styled how you'd actually wear it</p><p>✨ A real relationship — we're small, founder-led, and we grow with the people who grow with us</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>No minimums, no pressure. Post when it feels natural, tag us, and earn on everything you share.</p><p><br></p><p>Join here 👉 af.uppromote.com/akaliaofficial/register</p><p><br></p><p>We'd genuinely love to have you. 🤍</p><p><br></p><p>Warmly,</p><p>The Akalia team</p></div>",
